doc:Factsarticle_ijict_2025_10071717 schema:abstract "Distribution network management has emerged as a crucial aspect of socio-economic survival and a driver of global technological change. This study proposes a machine learning lifecycle management framework that targets performance maximisation, system resilience enhancement, and the reduction of environmental pollution. Advanced machine learning models are used in predictive maintenance, demand forecasting, fault detection, and energy flow optimization." .
